          }
        ],
        "text": "He also does not know about the Declaration of Independence, the Constitution, the Founding Fathers… it's insane.\n\nWhen I asked what American history he's learned, he says he's learned a lot about the native people. Basically nothing else.\n\nHamilton is required viewing this xmas"
