          "like_count": 25892,
          "quote_count": 1079,
          "reply_count": 3665,
          "retweet_count": 3968
        },
        "text": "My nephew (9) has never learned the Pledge of Allegiance, nor the National Anthem. He had not learned that America was founded in 1776.\n\nHe goes to public school in a state lauded for its public education.\n\nAre our schools run by anti-Americans? How is this possible?"
