          "reply_count": 52,
          "retweet_count": 69
        },
        "text": "Ilya Sutskever says that data is the fossil fuel of AI and \"we have achieved peak data\" because \"we have but one internet\", so the age of pre-training AI on bigger and bigger compute clusters \"will unquestionably end\" https://t.co/mG9jNdATFD"
