          "impression_count": 45984,
          "like_count": 237,
          "quote_count": 7,
          "reply_count": 17,
          "retweet_count": 17
        },
        "text": "Launching today as part of the 2024 TIME Person of the Year, TIME and Scale AI developed TIME AI.\n\nCongratulations to @realDonaldTrump on your 2nd time as the TIME Person of the Year.\n\nThank you to @jsibo, @markdhoward, @sampjacobs, and @Benioff for your great partnership. https://t.co/hhq5aI8YYY"
