        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1867251873268609302",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Compute matters, but so does data, and we have reached a pre-training data wall.\n\nGet ready for the post-training data boom. Companies will race to have the best frontier data—multi-modal, agentic, complex reasoning, and more.\n\nFollow the data, find the winners.\n\n7/8"
