        ],
        "text": "#3 The data race is the new chip race. \n\nWe’ve spent the last few years obsessed with computing power. \n\nWhether it’s GPUs or TPUs or beyond, most of the AI industry has been consumed by who has the biggest cluster.\n\n6/8"
