            "id": "1867251870856778017",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The models are becoming advanced enough for agentic tasks. What's needed is a UI and UX breakthrough that moves us past a chat interface. From chatting → doing.\n\nThis will start off as a fun “toy”, similar to ChatGPT, that grows into something people can’t see themselves living"
