        "text": "#2 Agent hype becomes real, for real people\n\nEveryone is always talking about agents, but the big breakthroughs have yet to happen\n\nIn 2025 we will see at least one primordial AI agent gain significant consumer adoption\n\nThere will be a 2022 ChatGPT moment, but for agents\n\n4/8"
