        "text": "The US must win here. Supplying the AI technology of the world is the tech equivalent of being the global reserve currency. It's a 100+-year investment.\n\nAI cannot be China’s next international expansion expedition like the Belts and Roads Initiative.\n\n3/8 https://t.co/zi2X6LCu5c"
